{"id":"bienvenida","lemma":"bienvenida","pos":"noun","rank":967,"glosses":["welcome","greeting"],"ipa":"/bjembeˈnida/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"bienvenidas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-bienvenida.wav","examples":[{"text":"El capitán nos dio la bienvenida.","en":"The captain welcomed us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639510","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"captain"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Me gustaría darles la bienvenida a bordo.","en":"I'd like to welcome you all aboard.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/831263","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to like in a general…","l":"gustar"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[5,7,"aboard"]]},{"text":"Fue una sorpresa de bienvenida.","en":"It was a welcome surprise.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/299996","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"surprise"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Siempre serás bienvenida.","en":"You will always be welcome.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639660","words":[{"g":"always"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"Cualquier cantidad de dinero será bienvenida.","en":"Any amount of money will be welcome.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1061791","words":[null,{"g":"amount"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"money"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]}]}